  description: '"Majestic Dragon" + "Red Dragon Archfiend" + 1 non-Tuner monster

    Cannot
    be destroyed by card effects. After damage calculation, if this card attacks:
    Destroy all Defense Position monsters on the field. Once per turn: You can target
    1 face-up monster your opponent controls; negate its effects, and if you do,
    this card gains ATK equal to that monster''s ATK. These changes last until the
    end of this turn. During the End Phase: Target 1 "Red Dragon Archfiend" in your
    Graveyard; return this card from the field to the Extra Deck, then Special Summon
    that target.'
